  "Wang Lung: \"What do you think you are doing?\"",
  "the second son: \"I am setting up a great grain market and I need money for it. I have my eyes on the fields.\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"You will not take what is mine without my say.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung steps forward and points to the fields.",
  "Wang Lung: \"These fields are not yours to take, nor mine to give.\"",
  "the eldest son: \"You will not touch the fields without my permission, nor will you take what is not yours.\"",
  "the eldest son: \"You think you can take what is not yours, but you will not take it without my say.\"",
